# S Standard Library API — FROZEN surface (3.4)

These builtins are the public stdlib surface. Prefer stability.

## Core I/O
- print(...), input(), read_file(path), write_file(path, text)

## Collections
- len, push, pop, map, filter, each, sort, unique, reverse
- keys, values, take, drop, find, zip, sum, any, all, contains

## Strings
- split, join, upper, lower, trim, replace, starts_with, ends_with, pad

## Numbers
- min, max, abs, floor, ceil, round, clamp

## Safety
- some, none, valueOr, ok, err, isOk, isErr, unwrap, require, freeze, assert

## Data / net
- json_parse, json_stringify, http_get, http_post

## Time / hash
- clock, now, hash(text [, algo])

## Modules (Slib)
- s.json, s.http, s.time, s.hash (thin wrappers)
